docs {
  ### API Endpoint: Get Template Details by ID
  
  This endpoint retrieves the details of a specific screen template, including its name and the configuration of all its zones. This information is crucial for understanding the layout and structure of the content displayed on a device.
  
  ---
  
  #### HTTP Method
  
  `GET`
  
  ---
  
  #### Endpoint
  
  `{{baseUrl}}/api/template/gettemplatebyid`
  
  ---
  
  #### Query Parameters
  
  - **templateId** (string, required): The unique identifier of the screen template. In this case, `051bf153-a760-4c32-a1ac-4ddf64cbd9ce`.
      
  
  ---
  
  #### Expected Response Format
  
  The response returns a single-element array containing an object with the template's details and a nested array of its configured zones.
  
  JSON
  
  ```
  [
      {
          "template": {
              "templateId": "051bf153-a760-4c32-a1ac-4ddf64cbd9ce",
              "name": "NCT Standard Template"
          },
          "templateZones": [
              {
                  "templateZoneId": "1a6ef200-fd02-43e1-b9e9-0cc59e0327f6",
                  "templateId": "051bf153-a760-4c32-a1ac-4ddf64cbd9ce",
                  "name": "Main",
                  "description": "Main",
                  "xPos": 0,
                  "yPos": 21,
                  "height": 828,
                  "width": 1472,
                  "background": "#1b4b60",
                  "order": 1,
                  "isMainZone": true
              },
              {
                  "templateZoneId": "8b260604-a293-4f5c-b6f2-cabbf4602135",
                  "templateId": "051bf153-a760-4c32-a1ac-4ddf64cbd9ce",
                  "name": "Horizontal",
                  "description": "Horizontal",
                  "xPos": 0,
                  "yPos": 870,
                  "height": 189,
                  "width": 1920,
                  "background": "#2989b2",
                  "order": 3,
                  "isMainZone": false
              },
              {
                  "templateZoneId": "c36a106f-2271-4709-88ae-a3bccdb1f81d",
                  "templateId": "051bf153-a760-4c32-a1ac-4ddf64cbd9ce",
                  "name": "Vertical",
                  "description": "Vertical",
                  "xPos": 1482,
                  "yPos": 21,
                  "height": 828,
                  "width": 438,
